a) Cach bo tri cht va so tren bien so 6 to cua co quan, to churc, ca nhan trong nuoc: Hai so dau la ky hieu dia phuong dang ky xe, tiep theo la seri dang ky (chur cai); nhom s6 thu hai la thur tu xe dang ky gom 05 chu s6 ty nhien tir 000.01 den 999.99;
b) Cach b6 tri chu va s6 tren bien so xe 6 to cua co quan, to churc, ca nhan nuoc ngoai: Hai s6 dau la ky hieu dia phuong dang ky xe, tiep theo nhom thu hai la ky hieu ten nuoc, yung lanh th6, to churc quoc te gom 03 so ty nhien va nhom thur ba la seri bien s6 chi nhom d6i tuong la to churc, ca nhan nuoc ngoai, nhom thu tu la thu tu xe dang ky gom 02 s6 tu nhien tu 01 dén 99;
